---@return posthog.review_hog.ReviewInstallationClaim? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_review_hog_installation_claims_partial(input) end

---Enable or disable a review perspective
---
---Toggle whether a `review-hog-perspective-*` skill runs on the requesting user's PR reviews. Only skills visible to the user — the canonicals plus the customs they authored — can be toggled; anything else 404s. Upserts the per-user config row, so enabling a freshly authored custom perspective works in one call. Rejected if it would leave the user with no enabled perspective.
---
---`PATCH /api/projects/{project_id}/review_hog/perspectives/{skill_name}/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.review_hog.UpdateReviewHogPerspectivesPartialRequest
---@return posthog.review_hog.ReviewPerspectiveConfig? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_review_hog_perspectives_partial(input) end

---Update the project's code review rule
---
---Partially update the project rule. Only the provided fields change. Project admins only.
---
---`PATCH /api/projects/{project_id}/review_hog/project_settings/`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden.
---@param input posthog.review_hog.UpdateReviewHogProjectSettingsPartialRequest
---@return posthog.review_hog.ReviewProjectSettings? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_review_hog_project_settings_partial(input) end

---Select the active resolution criteria
---
---Make a `review-hog-resolution-*` skill the single criteria the resolution stage applies on the requesting user's PRs, switching the user's other resolution skills off in the same call. Only skills visible to the user — the canonical plus the customs they authored — can be selected; anything else 404s. Upserts the per-user config row, so selecting a freshly authored custom skill works in one call.
---
---`PATCH /api/projects/{project_id}/review_hog/resolution/{skill_name}/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.review_hog.UpdateReviewHogResolutionPartialRequest
---@return posthog.review_hog.ReviewResolutionConfig? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_review_hog_resolution_partial(input) end

---Select the active review validator
---
---Make a `review-hog-validation-*` skill the single validator that runs on the requesting user's PR reviews, switching the user's other validators off in the same call. Only skills visible to the user — the canonical plus the customs they authored — can be selected; anything else 404s. Upserts the per-user config row, so selecting a freshly authored custom validator works in one call.
---
---`PATCH /api/projects/{project_id}/review_hog/validators/{skill_name}/`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.review_hog.UpdateReviewHogValidatorsPartialRequest
---@return posthog.review_hog.ReviewValidatorConfig? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_review_hog_validators_partial(input) end

